{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ASTRO AMIGO is a cozy, retro sci-fi adventure where a bullied kid, Austin, stumbles into a cosmic mystery after his beloved dog, Amigo, is taken by otherworldly beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With summer break just days away, can he survive school and save his best friend before it\u2019s too late?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn pixel art paired with an inspired original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rich, supernatural story shaped by  the choices you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feels like it was unearthed from a 1992 time capsule.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cozy action-adventure gameplay full of nostalgic charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Packed with quirky retro mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lovingly crafted by a passionate two-person team.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coming this summer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WARNING </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains flashing lights which may not be suitable for people with photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577850?t=1746429237","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/eee99331a33ffc4a315cf33c468aa214bdd99eff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746429237","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/56bc8a7d74f2aa34d164336052f189cad2230927/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746429237","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/56bc8a7d74f2aa34d164336052f189cad2230927/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746429237","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"des